		                     * The list of the first/last token pair of a removal range.
		                     * This is two parts because closing parentheses may exist between the method name and arguments.
		                     * E.g. `(function(){}.bind ) (obj)`
		                     *                    ^^^^^   ^^^^^ < removal ranges
